From f8fae36bff77c3bd2b25b2e3b27cbfad79c24423 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 04:29:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] memory: mtk-smi: Add MT6789 SMI support

Add MT6789 SMI Common and LARB platform data including GALS support,
MMU bus selection mask, and per-port outstanding request depth table.

Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/memory/mtk-smi.c | 45 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 45 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/memory/mtk-smi.c b/drivers/memory/mtk-smi.c
index 66bc2289f..98aba4d0d 100644
--- a/drivers/memory/mtk-smi.c
+++ b/drivers/memory/mtk-smi.c
@@ -283,6 +283,35 @@ static int mtk_smi_larb_config_port_gen2_general(struct device *dev)
 	return 0;
 }
 
